<div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
  <div class="mb-3">
    <h1 class="h3 fw-semibold mb-1">Add Authoritative Source</h1>
    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Add a reference to the library. By default it is available only to your organization/boundary; you can request instance-wide availability below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
      <%= render "form",
            form_url: authoritative_sources_path,
            form_method: :post,
            submit_label: "Add source" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# A control reference is a row pointing at this resource's id, so it needs a
      saved source to point at. Say that here rather than showing a form that
      cannot submit. %>
  <p class="text-body-secondary small mt-3 mb-0">
    Control references can be added once the source is saved — you will land on
    its page, where "Control references" is the next section.
  </p>
</div>
